---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Neurodivergent Nest is built by and for ADHD and neurodivergent adults tired of advice designed for neurotypical brains."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-stone-900 mb-6">About Neurodivergent Nest</h1>

    <div class="prose-custom">
      <p>
        Neurodivergent Nest exists because most productivity, organisation, and self-help content was built for neurotypical brains — and we're done pretending it works.
      </p>

      <p>
        We're a team of ADHD and neurodivergent adults who got fed up with advice like "just make a to-do list" and "set a timer." Advice that never asks <em>why</em> starting is so hard, why the list never gets touched, why the timer turns into a spiral of guilt.
      </p>

      <h2>What we actually do</h2>
      <p>
        Every article, resource recommendation, and strategy on this site is developed with neurodivergent brains in mind — built around executive function research, sensory processing, dopamine systems, and the real challenges of adult ADHD life.
      </p>
      <p>
        We cover: organisation, productivity, money management, work and career, relationships, parenting with ADHD, and the emotional side of living with a brain that society hasn't quite figured out how to accommodate yet.
      </p>

      <h2>Our editorial standards</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Science-backed</strong> — We reference peer-reviewed research and clinical guidelines, not just personal anecdotes.</li>
        <li><strong>Zero judgment</strong> — There is no "should" here. Only what works and what doesn't.</li>
        <li><strong>Transparent about money</strong> — Some links are affiliate links. We disclose every single one. We never recommend something we don't believe in.</li>
        <li><strong>Written by neurodivergent people</strong> — Not by marketing teams or AI bots. By people who live this.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        We'd love to hear from you — what topics you want covered, what's working, what isn't. Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@neurodivergent-nest.vercel.app">hello@neurodivergent-nest.vercel.app</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 bg-violet-50 border border-violet-100 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Join 10,000+ neurodivergent readers</h3>
      <p class="text-stone-500 mb-6">Get one practical system every Sunday. No spam, no guilt, no "try harder."</p>
      <a href="/newsletter" class="btn-primary">Subscribe Free</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
